#: 988c617121db4041bdaa4d1543164847
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_SCALING <RNGFND1_SCALING>` = 1"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_SCALING <RNGFND1_SCALING>` = 1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leddar-one-lidar.rst:29
#: 01a03e21af55426cbda993cc0d2d271d 235d3aaf47ce4a2e928c939dad685949
#: d42d7b24353f4c3abb0f2ef8b0ef83c1 f84cffea03344604951608bfa08478dc
#: fdbd7204f00b48c4af3bffa1f546151a
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.05"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.05"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leddar-one-lidar.rst:30
#: 4800725465844c2393b4449d49c0c054 504dbe6409474b5ab20d4af93e9e9234
#: b5c02a382bcf41da8590f4b511efc5d6 e7078a77599b4253a3d5b5e8388da4d7
#: f204ba6c078d4881b16f936bca16f178
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = **40** (40m) *This is the distance in "
"meters that the rangefinder can reliably read.*"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = **40** （40m） *这是测距仪可以可靠读取的距离（米）。*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leddar-one-lidar.rst:31
#: 4c2e7d61655c45d5abd159b726ef15d1 599c689405e841fd971d114c51bfac5e
#: b394238331114ff09615fd967fe83648 b99f9c1719ce4fc28159a110d88903ea
#: d433c262f1b84028beb035580b690218
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_GNDCLR <RNGFND1_GNDCLR>` = 0.1 *or more accurately the "
"distance in metres from the range finder to the ground when the vehicle is "
"landed.  This value depends on how you have mounted the rangefinder.*"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_GNDCLR <RNGFND1_GNDCLR>` = 0.1 "
"*或更精确地，飞行器降落时测距仪到地面的距离（米）。该值取决于测距仪的安装方式。*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leddar-one-lidar.rst:33
#: 0bada45fa13d4c27bb958b7ec17ca242 2bea4c207aed482f913c8c79f0a265c0
#: 69318a6548eb49eaafcf140bdb1bd1d2 6b0697b3611c4ce0aa9d8e5955bd8306
#: c114c11f1ee944eea90542ba0b66e8bc
msgid ""
"If you instead were using the Telem2 port on the Pixhawk then you would set "
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 9, and :ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD "
"<SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 115200"
msgstr ""
"如果改用 Pixhawk 的 Telem2 端口，则应设置 :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = "
"9，以及 :ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 115200"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leddar-one-lidar.rst:36
#: 3da287ed109448dd8f403d920b45e0b5 5d66351bab1b40faa830bff5ab1ca4b8
