msgstr "测试传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leddar-one-lidar.rst:38
#: 0821d958af454a4582280cf92d0f43cc 319d36ec5e504dd9aaf9ce16660f2755
#: 663e9115fcf6489496bcd73fb087e9a7 78a2e83ff6f84cd5aa179f572ad054b8
#: ab54a9d2599d4ab1acb1bf6687f4f8b3
msgid ""
"Distances read by the sensor can be seen in the Mission Planner's Flight "
"Data screen's Status tab. Look closely for \"rangefinder1\"."
msgstr "传感器读取的距离可在 Mission Planner 飞行数据界面的状态标签页中查看。请注意查找 「rangefinder1」。"
